<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Consolidated Gold to buy Kookynie gold tenements.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Consolidated Gold to buy Kookynie gold tenements.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consolidated Gold NL said on Monday it will pay A$500,000 for Horizon Mining NL's exploration tenements in the Kookynie region of Western Australia.</p>
<p>Earlier this month Consolidated Gold reached agreement to acquire the Lights of Israel underground gold mine from Aberfoyle Ltd near Davyhurst, Western Australia. The deal included the majority of Aberfoyle's gold tenement interests in the Kookynie region.</p>
</text>
